// Reflexes: involuntary motions that override the current action for a few
// ticks. One starts on the rising edge of its act locus past 0.5. Genes decide
// how easily the locus rises (sensitivity) and how high (strength).
// BLORB_REFLEX(id, name, actLocus, ticks, expr, pose)
BLORB_REFLEX(0, hop,    startle, 12, alarmed, hop)   // ask 8: shake, adrenaline, startle: squash, leap, land
BLORB_REFLEX(1, flinch, flinch,   6, alarmed, curl)  // a knock: hood up
